  "delivered": [
    "SLG eight-resource loading delegates reference ownership, deadline and cancellation to AssetLease while preserving all-settled validation, return shape and legacy error messages. Mini textures retain the raw texture API and pair each successful call with releaseSlgMapMini.",
    "Both SLG renderer constructors accept a globals-lease factory injected by the page through the kit install port. Linear tone mapping composes with stage tokens and other renderers without snapshot revival; no director.getScene remains in SLG.",
    "Stage3D skybox patches manage enabled, envmap, diffuseMap, reflectionMap and lighting for the active HDR/LDR slot. Baseline and every patch, including covered patches, hold distinct references through AssetRetainer; repeated resources within a patch are deduplicated.",
    "Resource replacements retain before applying. Successful writes/rollback remove scene references before releasing obsolete holds. Double apply/rollback failures retain candidates until a complete replay or scene teardown. The real adapter handles envmap setter side effects and rejects invalid cubemap classes even in hidden patches.",
    "Both framework fixture paths use complete AssetLease batches, and the temporary fixturePrefabLoader is removed. SLG map and mini textures retire after drawing; page close and map replacement cancel pending loads."
  ],
